# Keep working-tree bytes identical across Windows (core.autocrlf=true), WSL 2, and macOS
# so extracting the repository archive on Windows leaves a 100% clean `git status` and
# prevents CRLF from ever breaking `/usr/bin/env bash` scripts inside WSL 2.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
*.ps1 text eol=lf
*.ts text eol=lf
*.js text eol=lf
*.mjs text eol=lf
*.cjs text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.ini text eol=lf
*.svg text eol=lf

# Binary archives
*.tgz binary
*.gz binary
*.zip binary
*.bundle binary
